<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Suburban Ostomy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Suburban Ostomy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter Reynolds initiated coverage of Suburban Ostomy Supply Co Inc  with a buy rating, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/2 at 12-7/8.</p>
